{{#each results}}
People are assigned to the central security roles of the organisation, and they know their responsibilities. The roles of a single development project are assigned in that project.

== How to decide if this control is required

This control is always required. The other central controls need people who do the work.

== How to implement

Create the central security role assignments. The template has the roles that the other central controls need. Set the assignee of each role in its *Owner* field, and add other roles when needed. Then review the assignments, and mark the review as passed.

{{#report}}
  "name": "ismsa/reports/createEvidence",
  "identifier": "ismsa_review_central-role-assignments",
  "template": "ismsa/templates/centralRoleAssignments",
  "buttonLabel": "Create the central security role assignments"
{{/report}}

Check that each role has an assignee, that each assignment is up to date, and that the assignees know about their roles.

{{#if this.craGuidance}}
== EU Cyber Resilience Act

The deadlines of 24 hours in Article 14 of the CRA (Regulation (EU) 2024/2847) apply on every day of the year. Name a deputy for the product security operations responsible and for the incident response lead.
